.nh
.TH "GUMROAD" "1" "Sep 2026" "Gumroad" "Gumroad CLI"

.SH NAME
gumroad-marketing-schedule - Execute an approved action now through the server's channel executor. This version does not support future dates: schedule posts immediately, not later. Approve first. Repeating it resolves the same action, never a second post.


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBgumroad marketing schedule  [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
Execute an approved action now through the server's channel executor. This version does not support future dates: schedule posts immediately, not later. Approve first. Repeating it resolves the same action, never a second post.

.PP
The confirmation preview uses quoted strings so control characters cannot hide content. --yes explicitly confirms for scripts and MCP clients; approve and schedule also require --confirmation-token from the preview the seller reviewed. --dry-run still fetches the action for its preview, but sends no mutation. Human and plain output include the server's reconnect path and manual-share URL after the error code when available.


.SH OPTIONS
\fB--confirmation-token\fP=""
	Token from the reviewed action (required with --yes for approve and schedule)

.PP
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	help for schedule


.SH OPTIONS INHERITED FROM PARENT COMMANDS
\fB--debug\fP[=false]
	Enable debug logging to stderr

.PP
\fB--dry-run\fP[=false]
	Preview mutating requests without executing them

.PP
\fB--jq\fP=""
	Filter JSON output with a jq expression

.PP
\fB--json\fP[=false]
	Output as JSON

.PP
\fB--no-color\fP[=false]
	Disable color output

.PP
\fB--no-image\fP[=false]
	Disable image rendering

.PP
\fB--no-input\fP[=false]
	Disable interactive prompts

.PP
\fB--non-interactive\fP[=false]
	Run in explicit CI/agent mode

.PP
\fB--page-delay\fP=0s
	Wait between paginated --all requests (e.g. 200ms, 1s)

.PP
\fB--plain\fP[=false]
	Output as plain tab-separated text

.PP
\fB-q\fP, \fB--quiet\fP[=false]
	Suppress non-essential output

.PP
\fB--yes\fP[=false]
	Skip confirmation prompts


.SH EXAMPLE
.EX
  gumroad marketing schedule <action>
.EE


.SH SEE ALSO
\fBgumroad-marketing(1)\fP
